    "title": "Vacancy for Hotel Manager at Oberoi Hotels",
    "description": "If you're a passionate Hotel Manager with drive and ambition, Oberoi Hotels in Varanasi is the place for you. We're growing fast and need talented people to grow with us.\n\nAbout Oberoi Hotels:\nOberoi Hotels is a leading organization in the Remote sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Monitor F&B service quality and maintain hygiene standards\n• Deliver exceptional guest experiences in line with brand standards\n• Handle guest complaints and resolve issues promptly\n• Develop and maintain relationships with corporate clients\n• Manage front office operations including check-in/check-out\n• Conduct regular guest satisfaction surveys and implement improvements\n• Prepare daily operating reports and present to management\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• B.Tech / B.E. in Computer Science or related discipline\n• 3-6 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Sommelier Skills\n• Proficiency in HACCP\n• Proficiency in PMS Systems\n• Proficiency in Tour Planning\n• Proficiency in Front Office\n• Proficiency in Travel Management\n• Proficiency in MICE\n• Proficiency in Yield Management\n\nWork Mode: Remote - Work from anywhere in India\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Company-sponsored certifications\n• Professional development and training programs\n• Transportation and conveyance allowance\n• Employee stock options (ESOPs) for eligible roles\n• Flexible working hours\n• Life and accident insurance\n• Salary Range: 7 LPA - 15 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Varanasi, Uttar Pradesh, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Oberoi Hotels!",
